Xiu: Oh no! Roro! Are you okay?
Roro: I’m fine! Don’t worry, I’m a master plumber. I got this!!! 
#nervous roro expression
[#nervous] Roro: (I am so cooked).
#Start of plumbing puzzle
#thinking roro expression
[#thinking] Roro: Maybe if I just turn some pipes around, it'll fix itself!
Roro: I can do this. I'm a nimble raccoon!
#Solves Puzzle
