[#surprised] Roro: Oh my god I actually did it??
Roro: WOW! Maybe I AM the best plumber in New York!
Roro: I can put this on my LockedIn!
#End of plumbing puzzle
#happy xiu expression
[#happy] Xiu: Roro! I am so glad you’re okay! 
#happy roro expression
[#happy] Roro: Of course I am, Xiu. All those years at community college really paid off. Never doubt me!
Xiu: Let’s continue on. My family will be so excited to meet a master plumber!
Roro: Yes!
Roro: (YES!! I'M NO LONGER A LIAR OR A FRAUD. I HAVE CREDIBILITY!!)
#Gameplay: They go to meet Xiu’s family. 
# [SCENE: Xiu's Living Room, with a big couch for the dad...]
#happy xiu expression
[#happy] Xiu: Father! I am home and I have brought a friend!
Xiu’s Father: Huh?
Xiu’s father turns around and finds his daughter and a raccoon in his house! He stares at you, hard.
Xiu's Father: Huh. Ain't your friend a lil big for a rat?
Xiu: Father this is Roro, she is a raccoon! She is a master plumber, in fact she is the only master plumber in New York!
Xiu Father: Well ain't that nice, huh?
#happy roro expression
[#happy] Roro: Nice to meet ya, Papa Xiu!
Xiu's Father: Huh?
Roro: [i]NICE TO MEET YA, PAPA XIU![/i]
Xiu winced at your volume, while her dad stared at you, unphased.
Xiu's Father: Why are ya whisperin'?
... You think about the irony of Xiu's excellent ears paired with her father's... questionable hearing.
Xiu: Well, my friend here fixed one of the entrance pipes! 
Roro: YES SIR, IT SHOULDN'T BOTHER ANYONE EVER AGAIN, SIR!
Xiu's Father: Huh. 
… You think that was maybe excitement?
Xiu's Father: Well, if yer so great, can ya fix this other pipe over 'ere, huh?
Xiu's Father: Here, I put it on yer map for ya. Shouldn't be hard to miss.
#embarrassed xiu expression
[#embarrassed] Xiu: Father! We shouldn't shamelessly ask that...
Xiu's Father: Well, sugarcube, we ain't really rich on options here. Ya know yer aunt damn near almost died the other day.
Xiu: Yes… I know, father…
Roro: WELL, PAPA XIU, SHE WON’T DIE ON MAH WATCH.
Xiu’s Father: ... huh. Ya like watches?
Xiu's Father: You know what, since you fixed up that lil' pipe for us, I've got somethin' for you.
#happy roro expression
[#happy] Roro: WOW REALLY.
Xiu's Father: 'Course! I ain't gon' let ya solve our problems for free, now. We rats got honor, ye hear!
Roro: HEARD! 
Papa Xiu hands you a mysterious device.
#thinking roro expression 
[#thinking] Roro: Wow, this looks like...
Roro: What is this.
Xiu: It's like an RV plane!
Roro: A what.
Roro: Can I eat it?
Xiu's Father: HA! Nah, stripes. This thing here can let ya fly up.
#surprised roro expression 
[#surprised] Roro: WOAH.
Xiu's Father: Ain't nobody here cares 'bout flying up to those damn pigeons no more. Not after what they've done to us.
Xiu: ...
Xiu's Father: So you'd be doin' me a grand favor by takin' this off mah hands.
Jetpack Received! You now have access to the Pigeon's Realm!
#happy xiu expression
[#happy] Xiu: Thank you, so much, again, Roro. 
#neutral roro expression 
[#neutral] Roro: It’s no problem! That was nothing for me!
Xiu: Well, I'll show Roro the way out. We've been taking up a lot of her time.
Xiu's Father: Ah, alright. Stay safe out there, sugarcube.
Xiu: I will, father.
